A [[Sentience|sentient]] '''species''' had [[Color|yellow]] skin, gray [[hair]], and orange [[eye]]s. [[Mennis Duren]] was a member of this species, who was present on the [[Ring of Kafrene]] trading outpost<ref name="Rogue One" /> in [[1 BBY]].<ref name="Date">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]'' dates the events of ''[[Rogue One: A Star Wars Story]]'' to [[1 BBY]].</ref>

